// Summary
// Models define database tables.

// Scalar types define column types.

// @id marks primary key.

// @relation defines foreign keys and relations.

// Enums define fixed sets of values.

// Timestamps with @default(now()) and @updatedAt for creation/update times.

// @map to specify exact DB table names.

// Relations (one-to-many, many-to-one) expressed by FK fields + relation attributes.

